// provenance: G15 (ADR-0010) — commutation declared GENERICALLY: universals
// in vocabulary, instances derived. `a` and `b` are pattern variables (they
// name no declared stage); writes_disjoint is the first COMPUTED guard — the
// harness asserts it from declared write-sets (both orders), never by hand.
equivalence stage_commutation {
    a then b
    <=>
    b then a

    guards {
        writes_disjoint = true
    }
}
